  slug: "used-car-dealer-marketing-budget",
  title: "Used Car Dealer Marketing on a Budget: High-ROI Strategies",
  metaDescription: "A practical budget playbook for independent used car dealers: where to allocate limited marketing dollars, how to use Facebook Marketplace, Google Ads, SEO, and reviews to compete with bigger franchise stores.",
